nature-test/mods/a.n:1:1: 'mod Mods' does not match directory 'mods', use 'mod mods'

=== test_import_source_part
--- package.toml
name = "modtest"
version = "1.0.0"
type = "bin"

--- main.n
import modtest.mods.a

fn main() {
    println(a.a())
}

--- mods/a.n
mod mods

fn a():int {
    return 1
}

--- mods/b.n
mod mods

fn b():int {
    return 2
}

--- output.txt
nature-test/main.n:1:7: 'modtest.mods.a' is not a module, it is part of modtest.mods, use 'import modtest.mods'

